solution:
**Given:**

M₁ = 3 men

D₁ = 4 days

W₁ = 39 feet

W₂ = 78 feet

D₂ = 12 days

**Formula used:**

dfrac{M₁ times D₁}{W₁} = dfrac{M₂ times D₂}{W₂}

**Calculation:**

dfrac{3 times 4}{39} = dfrac{M₂ times 12}{78}

⇒ dfrac{12}{39} = dfrac{M₂ times 12}{78}

⇒ dfrac{1}{39} = dfrac{M₂}{78}

⇒ M₂ = dfrac{78}{39}

⇒ M₂ = 2

**∴ The correct answer is option (4).**
